{"path":"ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator/operator_cmp","title":"operator==(ranges::chunk_view::outer-iterator)","titleHtml":"operator==<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(ranges::chunk_view::<i>outer-iterator</i>)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator/operator_cmp","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Compares the iterator and the sentinel.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*outer-iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x, <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2896\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel_t</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator\">iterator</a> and the <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\">sentinel</a>.\n</p><p>Let <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator#Data_members\"><code><i>parent_</i></code></a> be the underlying pointer to enclosing <code>chunk_view</code>. Equivalent to:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">parent_</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>current_ <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">parent_</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span> and x.<span class=\"me1\">parent_</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>remainder_ <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>This function  is not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when <code>std::ranges::chunk_view::<i>outer-iterator</i></code> is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p><p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> x\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator\">iterator</a> to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The result of comparison.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/chunk_view","title":"std::ranges::views::chunk, std::ranges::chunk_view"},{"path":"ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator","title":"std::ranges::chunk_view<V>::outer-iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator==(ranges::chunk_view::outer-iterator)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Compares the iterator and the sentinel."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"x"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The result of comparison."}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":83,"codeBlockCount":1}
